 Hawking lost his long battle"},{"x":0.077777794760101951,"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.42666664123535158,"text":"with motor neuron disease, and the world lost a scientist who","y":0.75714285714808471},{"text":"had made an enormous contribution to our understanding of","y":0.76859714361606446,"x":0.07542933651846806,"w":0.43139011383056647,"h":0.016518536003268469},{"y":0.78633720958907105,"h":0.010174418079609837,"text":"the universe.","w":0.086666660308837906,"x":0.075555557290025555},{"text":"Much has been written about Hawking. The scientific community","x":0.077777791974916716,"y":0.80367346966009301,"w":0.42666664123535147,"h":0.013186995837153215},{"text":"his achievements at an early","y":0.81831395370371818,"x":0.29111111960227321,"w":0.21333332061767574,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"text":"stage in his career. It was a surprisingly long career if you consider","h":0.013469387755102091,"x":0.077777795011953685,"w":0.42666664123535158,"y":0.83265306155114238},{"y":0.84734693885672729,"text":"the disease that robbed him of speech and movement. For this","x":0.07777779404899085,"w":0.42666664123535158,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"w":0.089143934249877932,"x":0.074577295920360914,"y":0.85838656480822051,"h":0.018191687136280388,"text":"reason, he 2"},{"text":"the respect of people","x":0.36000000551428896,"y":0.86191860482290417,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.14444443702697757},{"y":0.87499999976438181,"text":"around the world for his extraordinary will to live, as well as his","h":0.01316326530612244,"x":0.077777794760101951,"w":0.42666664123535158},{"h":0.010321547060596736,"text":"brilliant mind.","x":0.075555558311679399,"y":0.88938775494795808,"w":0.093333330154418942},{"text":"As a respected scientist, he was often asked for his views","h":0.013119363590162636,"x":0.077777791752694544,"y":0.90693877588964156,"w":0.42666664123535164},{"y":0.9228571427335962,"w":0.42888889312744138,"h":0.011836734693877471,"text":"on many subjects. Concerning artificial intell