s many people is the fact that Hawking was never","x":0.53333333886927614,"y":0.80367346960565089,"h":0.014693877551020473},{"y":0.81686046520922617,"h":0.010174418079609726,"text":"6","x":0.53111111133113698,"w":0.01111111044883728},{"h":0.010350023386429763,"x":0.74222222848299679,"w":0.20222221374511717,"y":0.8195918367725612,"text":"a Nobel Prize. This is because"},{"w":0.4133333206176758,"y":0.8326530613512878,"text":"theoretical scientific discoveries, like Hawking's, have to be","h":0.013469387755102091,"x":0.53111111230227337},{"y":0.84734693874006517,"w":0.41111110687255858,"text":"established by data before they can be considered for a Nobel.","h":0.013118177919971719,"x":0.53333333541557248},{"x":0.53111111968299685,"y":0.86191860465173653,"h":0.01318343649105147,"w":0.38222221374511711,"text":"It is impossible to see black holes with current telescopes."},{"text":"As an icon of popular culture, Hawking ?","x":0.53333333569886998,"y":0.87918367324972491,"h":0.013258187430245538,"w":0.26222221374511723},{"y":0.89534883742464855,"text":"many mentions in the press and also appeared on the TV series,","h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.40888889312744148,"x":0.53333333530294591},{"text":"such as The Big Bang Theory, The Simpsons and Star Trek.","y":0.90843023339784845,"x":0.5311111134155726,"w":0.41111110687255858,"h":0.014534882526008541},{"y":0.92285714268514663,"x":0.53333333994225607,"text":"The Next Generation.","w":0.14222221374511723,"h":0.011836734693877582}]